{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/111117_214051.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(・∀・∩)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0095.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超絶楽しみにしていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋の告白イベでした(愛´艸｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いらした方お疲れ様でしたぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0296.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せすぎたぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0294.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0295.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりファンの方に間近で会えたり、お話するのってスッゴい幸せだよね!!録音は恥ずかしかったけど(σ*´∀｀)照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな超レシーブ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ会えてない人!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ機会はある(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対会おうね♪♪私は会うつもりまんまん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0202.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0214.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまでにコメントとかしてくれたら名前覚えられるようにするね!!次の機会!!本当に楽しみだ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日改めて思ったこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私含め乃木坂46は恵まれてるってこと。支えられてるってこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のスタッフの方が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影で壮大な努力をしてくださってることや大変な準備もしてくれること。何よりも私たちのことを一番に考えてくれること。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々感謝です…本当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ファンのみなさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グダったＭＣすみませんでした（つд；*)けどメンバーが支えて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0055.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度の人生の中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなにも沢山の方に好きだって言ってもらえるなんて、私は世界一の幸せものだと思う。私のことを考えてくれて、知りたいって思ってくれるなんて…その上応援してくれるなんて。幸せなんて言葉じゃ言い切れません。だからこそ、精一杯返したい。みなさんに幸せを倍にして返したい!!そう強く思いました♪私に出来ることを精一杯やりたい!!やらせてほしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月の最大の目標は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人でも多くの人の人生に良い影響として関わること!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、幸せの手伝いをすること!!必ず成し遂げます!ファンレターやプレゼント…コメント…書いてくれる時や選んでくれる時。みなさんの貴重なお時間を私のために…・゜・(つД｀)・゜・もう号考えただけで泣ものですよ…若月は…。\nよしゃやあああああ!若月頑張るo(｀^´*)!大好きなみなさんの為に闘魂パワーで頑張る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のファンの皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から感謝しています。ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも乃木坂46は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長を続けるので温かく見守ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※風邪に気をつけてというコメントありがとうございました(σ*´∀｀)みなさんも気をつけてね(;;)笑った顔"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/dimg0179.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が見たいとのことで…普段あんまり全力で自分の笑った顔なんて照れ臭くて撮らないんですが…どうぞΣ(ノд<)恥ずかしー！照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/17/111113_010621_ed.jpg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}